# Only the sources the build needs. The toolchain file is left out: the build image already is that toolchain.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
crates/*/tests/
crates/ui/bench/
# The brand kit's tokens, emblem and READY lettering, which the workbench's assets link to.
!docs/brand-kit/stage-select-tokens.css
!docs/brand-kit/stage-select-emblem-small.svg
!docs/brand-kit/stage-select-ready.svg
# Stage Select's licence, for the workbench's About page.
!LICENSE
# The clone-list pins, which the binary embeds, and the script that fetches what they pin.
!third_party/clone-lists/pins.toml
!tools/clone-lists/fetch
# The curated-list pin, and the script that fetches what it pins.
!third_party/curated-list/pins.toml
!tools/curated-list/fetch
# Retool's licence, for the About page: the selection engine is a port of Retool.
!third_party/retool/LICENSE
# The stand-in for SDL that chdman is built with.
!tools/chdman/sdl-stub.c
